WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:06.480
<i>This city has a great barrier
that separates the people.</i>

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.320
<i>That barrier is the Resident
Registration System.</i>

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.660
<i>There are the registered residents
with ID cards called competenters</i>

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.830
<i>and the unregistered
residents without ID cards</i>

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.730
<i>called incompetenters.</i>

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:22.670
<i>Registered residents have their lives,
work, medical care, education...</i>

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>Various aspects of their lives
are guaranteed by the city.</i>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.380
<i>But that is not true
for the unregistered residents.</i>

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.710
<i>None of those things
are guaranteed to them.</i>

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.280
<i>Thus, there is a great barrier there.</i>

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:44.260
<i>Competenters and incompetenters:
A barrier that divides the people.</i>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.350
<i>Well, I don't really care
about such things, though!</i>

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:23.090
<i>Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:31.270
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Bokura wa marude ichimai-chigai
no guuzen o sagashiatte</i>

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.420
<i>Meguriatta</i>

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:51.490
<i>Kimi ga itsuka
nomikonda sono kotoba yori</i>

00:01:51.490 --> 00:02:00.430
<i>Zutto iezu ni
itekureteta yasashisa o</i>

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:07.410
<i>Shinjitai to ima omounda</i>

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:15.150
<i>Nee kono saki wa doko made mo
fuan to tonari-awase</i>

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:21.550
<i>Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai</i>

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:29.260
<i>Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:35.430
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:39.340
<i>Tsumikasanete
yuku mono</i>

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.480
<i>"Beloved Daughter"
So this is the guy...</i>

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.950
He's the perpetrator of the P-10
crystals incident two days ago.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.780
<i>Two security guards were shot.</i>

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.120
<i>A murderer?</i>

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.750
<i>Fortunately, I've heard that
they've both managed to survive.</i>

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.450
<i>An unregistered resident, huh?</i>

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.590
<i>Finding him will take some doing.</i>

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:05.460
<i>What are these P-10
crystals that were stolen?</i>

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.160
It's...

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.460
<i>It's a rare crystal.</i>

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.300
<i>Compared to normal crystals,</i>

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.240
<i>it has greater clarity
and light refractivity.</i>

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.940
<i>And it has a property that allows it
to convert light to energy.</i>

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.440
<i>It's a crystal</i>

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:22.940
<i>that's garnering a lot of attention
as a new type of material.</i>

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:27.050
<i>However, the refining process
for pure P-10 crystals is difficult</i>

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.650
<i>and it has high scarcity value.</i>

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:33.390
<i>For all that, I heard he made off
with quite a quantity.</i>

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:35.490
<i>He likely got second rate goods.</i>

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:38.190
<i>But even that has many uses.</i>

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.700
<i>Though, in a state with
impurities mixed in it,</i>

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.130
<i>it's physically unstable
and needs to be handled with care.</i>

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.100
<i>Well?</i>

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.440
<i>Will you take this job?</i>

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.870
<i>Scarcity?</i>

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:48.970
All right.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.210
<i>Roy, telephone.</i>

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.040
<i>I transferred the call over there.</i>

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.550
<i>It's me.</i>

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.980
<i>Okay, I'm going to process it.</i>

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.420
<i>Pretty-?</i>

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.210
<i>What?!
Are you sure?!</i>

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.000
<i>Mr. Roy!</i>

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.090
<i>Solty!</i>

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.540
<i>Is this work, Mr. Roy?</i>

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.160
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.250
<i>What was that phone call about?</i>

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:34.380
<i>Oh, could it be that you
found out where our guy is?!</i>

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.350
<i>Mr. Roy?</i>

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.920
<i>Are you listening?</i>

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.950
<i>You could answer
some of our que...</i>

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.180
Shut up!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.530
<i>My daughter's been found.</i>

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:46.730
What?

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.850
<i>Daughter?</i>

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.230
Dad!

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.840
<i>Not so tough, huh?</i>

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:58.810
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.480
<i>I've been looking
for her all this time...</i>

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.560
<i>Is it that house?</i>

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.000
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.260
<i>I am happy for you.
You have finally found her!</i>

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.610
<i>Solty, let's go!</i>

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.580
Right.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.130
<i>Yes?</i>

00:05:56.130 --> 00:06:00.070
<i>Is Ms. Rita Revant home?</i>

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:04.940
<i>I'm Rita. May I ask
who you are?</i>

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:09.110
<i>My name is Roy Revant.</i>

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.100
<i>I'll get the door.
Please wait a moment.</i>

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.240
<i>Well, Roy?</i>

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.200
<i>Mr. Roy?</i>

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.370
It's...

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.840
<i>It's not her.</i>

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.880
<i>I see.</i>

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.550
<i>You came looking
for your daughter...</i>

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.520
<i>Y-Yeah.</i>

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:58.560
<i>My "Revant" surname was given to me
by the city when I was registered.</i>

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:04.230
<i>In Blast Fall twelve years ago,
my eyes and legs were injured.</i>

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.030
<i>I was five years old at the time</i>

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:09.040
<i>and I only remembered
my first name, "Rita".</i>

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.640
<i>After that, I was taken
in by an orphanage.</i>

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.410
<i>So you're a New Rights Child.</i>

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.680
<i>New Rights?</i>

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.410
<i>When Blast Fall happened,</i>

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:22.250
<i>many young, unidentified children
were taken in by orphanages.</i>

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.550
<i>So a law was passed</i>

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:27.560
<i>to unconditionally grant
residency to those children.</i>

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:30.560
<i>Those children are called
New Rights Children.</i>

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.930
<i>And I am one of them.</i>

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:38.630
<i>Thanks to that, I can receive
welfare and live here.</i>

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:39.830
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.840
<i>Yes. I am sorry.</i>

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.000
<i>There's no need
for you to apologize.</i>

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.910
<i>It's Uncle!</i>

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:52.850
<i>Uncle?</i>

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.080
<i>Yes, he says my father
was good to him in the past,</i>

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.920
<i>so he has been
looking after me.</i>

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.460
Rita.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.900
<i>Come inside. I have
some guests right now.</i>

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:10.900
<i>Guests?</i>

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:11.960
<i>Come in.</i>

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.610
Oh! Oh! Oh!

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.650
<i>Is something...</i>

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:24.510
Rita!

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.980
<i>A-Are you okay, Rita?</i>

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.420
<i>Yes, I'm sorry.</i>

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.590
<i>Thank you.
You're very strong.</i>

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:41.260
<i>Oh, not at all.</i>

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:45.000
<i>If only I were
strong like you.</i>

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.830
<i>It is nothing.</i>

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:50.870
Uh, um...

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:51.840
What is it?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.280
<i>Do you live alone here?</i>

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.010
<i>Yes.</i>

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.750
<i>Is it not rather difficult?</i>

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.950
<i>It doesn't bother me.</i>

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.550
<i>- What?
- Because I have Uncle.</i>

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.620
<i>I'm grateful to him.</i>

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.990
<i>He's looked after me
all this time.</i>

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:08.490
<i>I can't begin to tell you
how much he's helped me.</i>

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:11.660
<i>No amount of gratitude
could repay for what he's done.</i>

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.790
<i>I think of him as a
precious part of my family.</i>

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.580
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.950
<i>I received an order
to catch you this morning.</i>

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.020
<i>What's that girl to you?</i>

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.120
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.120
Rita is...

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:42.920
<i>...my daughter.</i>

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:45.290
<i>Damn it!
Quit joking around!</i>

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:49.100
<i>You're her father?!
Then why haven't you claimed her?!</i>

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.070
<i>I'm an unregistered resident!</i>

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.230
<i>If they find out her father
is an unregistered resident,</i>

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.740
<i>Rita will be stripped
of the residency she's been given!</i>

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.440
<i>There's no way
I could claim her!</i>

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:03.340
<i>And to top it all off,
you're a criminal now.</i>

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:06.550
<i>It's to restore light to her!</i>

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:11.250
<i>Do you know how much it costs
to resemblize eyes and legs?!</i>

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:14.360
<i>No matter how earnestly
us outlaws worked,</i>

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.960
<i>we could never scrape together
that kind of money!</i>

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.890
<i>That's why you took
the P-10 crystals...</i>

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:23.130
<i>Rita's lived in darkness
for twelve whole years!</i>

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:26.170
<i>If there's any chance
of restoring her sight,</i>

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:29.440
<i>I'll cling to any
means I might have!</i>

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.670
<i>That's right!
Any means!</i>

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:34.280
<i>Roy!</i>

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.330
<i>Hold it!</i>

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.550
<i>Mr. Roy.</i>

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:43.950
What is it?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.390
<i>Are you going to
apprehend Mr. Vincent?</i>

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.020
<i>Are you going to
apprehend him?</i>

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:06.070
<i>Don't get so rattled, Vincent.</i>

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:10.150
<i>Cary, a... a hunter
came to my place...</i>

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.380
<i>I know that.</i>

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:13.380
<i>Don't worry about it.</i>

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:17.420
<i>I got caught on camera
during that P-10 crystals job.</i>

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:19.990
<i>You said the security
there was light!</i>

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.360
<i>It was light
when I checked into it.</i>

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.290
<i>I'm as surprised as you are.</i>

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:29.060
<i>But it was my mistake.
I'm sorry.</i>

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.370
<i>No...</i>

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.530
<i>Relax, Vincent.</i>

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:35.240
<i>The arrangements for Rita's
surgery have been made.</i>

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.070
<i>And we've almost got the money.</i>

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.140
<i>Plus, everything's set
for the next job.</i>

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:43.700
<i>All that's left is for you to decide
whether you'll do it or not.</i>

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.420
<i>What do we do
about the hunter?</i>

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:52.820
<i>Just leave it to me. I'll take
care of him one way or another.</i>

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:55.950
<i>You can count on your
broker, Cary Jones.</i>

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.930
<i>Rita, it won't be long now.</i>

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.930
<i>Soon, you'll have
your sight back.</i>

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:10.640
<i>When you do,
I'll disappear.</i>

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.010
<i>After all, I can't have you
realizing I'm your dad,</i>

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:17.810
<i>once you've regained your sight.</i>

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:21.150
<i>You'll be fine.
You're a strong girl.</i>

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:23.120
<i>Once you have
your eyes and legs back,</i>

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.190
<i>you'll be able to make your way
through life on your own.</i>

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:30.060
<i>This is my last job.</i>

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.790
<i>Mr. Vincent.</i>

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.700
<i>You could let it slide,
just this once!</i>

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.140
<i>That idiot...</i>

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:00.490
<i>The hospital has released
the results of the DNA test.</i>

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:04.150
<i>Vincent and Rita are, without a doubt,
father and daughter.</i>

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.630
<i>Yeah?
It's me.</i>

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:15.370
<i>Roy? I've got the information
you asked me to check for.</i>

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:16.770
<i>Let's hear it.</i>

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.540
<i>Vincent Greco.</i>

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.610
<i>He has theft on record in the past.</i>

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.910
<i>But since then, it looks like
he'd been working honest jobs</i>

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.180
<i>until the P-10 crystals incident.</i>

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:31.050
<i>He had a wife and a daughter,
but his wife died in Blast Fall</i>

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.890
<i>and his daughter
is on file as missing.</i>

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:36.260
<i>And that only
daughter of his is...</i>

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.660
Rita.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:40.900
<i>It sounds like the situation
has gotten rather messy.</i>

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.000
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.430
It's all right.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:47.100
<i>More importantly, be careful.
Vincent's backer is...</i>

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:48.670
Miranda?

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:49.830
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.780
<i>Are you really sure about this?</i>

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:03.750
<i>Yes, please allow me to help you.</i>

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.950
<i>This is all for Miss Rita's sake.</i>

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:07.160
<i>You're right.</i>

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.360
<i>Stop right there.</i>

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.660
<i>Put both hands on your head
and get down on your knees!</i>

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.060
<i>M-Mr. Roy!</i>

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:16.260
<i>Do as I said!</i>

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:20.500
<i>You idiot! What's the point
in you becoming a criminal, too?!</i>

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.540
<i>Vincent Greco, as the perpetrator
of the P-10 crystals robbery,</i>

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.740
<i>there is a bounty on your head.</i>

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.110
<i>If you resist...</i>

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.540
<i>Please do not do this!</i>

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:32.150
<i>What would be the harm
in letting him go?!</i>

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:34.050
<i>Mr. Vincent is doing this
for Miss Rita...</i>

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:37.020
<i>Yuto's been shot.</i>

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.850
<i>He's not dead, but he's been
taken to the hospital.</i>

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.160
<i>Knowing that, can you still
say what you just said?!</i>

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.400
<i>Even if you use the money you've gained
from your crimes to cure her,</i>

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:51.200
<i>do you actually think
that'll make her happy?!</i>

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.400
<i>Don't give me that
hypocrisy, Roy Revant.</i>

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.870
<i>You're still looking for your
own daughter, aren't you?!</i>

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.870
<i>Can't you understand how I feel?!</i>

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:04.210
<i>Is what you're doing really going to lead
to your daughter's happiness?!</i>

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.850
<i>It will!
Of course, it will!</i>

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:10.310
<i>That's why I'd do
anything for Rita!</i>

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.850
<i>Mr. Vincent!</i>

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:20.800
<i>Bravo! Bravo!</i>

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:23.830
<i>That was a splendid little
performance, my dear Vincent.</i>

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.030
<i>However...</i>

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.000
<i>...it's time we
brought this to an end.</i>

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.660
C-Cary...

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:33.200
<i>Ah-ah! You'd better not move.</i>

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:41.580
<i>Now, do you understand
the situation?</i>

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.820
<i>You tricked me?</i>

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:45.190
<i>Tricked you?</i>

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:48.790
<i>You're wrong about that,
my dear Vincent.</i>

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:52.230
<i>I'd planned to do this all along.</i>

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:55.430
<i>I've long lived on the
seamier side of society,</i>

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.870
<i>but I've become somewhat tired
of dealing with bloody matters,</i>

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:03.940
<i>so I thought I'd buy my residency
and live a leisurely life on the up-and-up.</i>

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.280
<i>And you've made the money
to make that possible.</i>

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.680
<i>The P-10 crystals.</i>

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:12.010
<i>With impurities, the quality is second rate,
but it'll be good money.</i>

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.810
<i>On top of which,
it can also be used like this.</i>

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.890
<i>Isn't that something?</i>

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:23.830
<i>Wh-What about Rita's...
r-resemble operation?</i>

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:27.130
<i>Oh, that was a lie.</i>

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.030
<i>Mr. Vincent!</i>

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:33.330
<i>Oh, yes. Sorry, but you two
over there will be joining him.</i>

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:36.600
<i>The bounty, who'd gone so far
as to attempt a bank robbery,</i>

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.440
<i>and the hunter, who came
in pursuit of the bounty.</i>

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.110
<i>After a tough fight,</i>

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.410
<i>the P-10 crystals the bounty
had on him explode,</i>

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.810
<i>catching them in the blast
and killing both parties.</i>

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:48.820
<i>The stolen money is burnt
to ash and vanishes...</i>

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:51.950
<i>But the truth of it will be
that it goes into my pocket.</i>

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.920
<i>Interesting scenario,
don't you think?</i>

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:56.420
<i>You will not
get away with this.</i>

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:58.630
<i>You deceived Mr. Vincent and...</i>

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.650
<i>You people will never
get away with this!</i>

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.770
<i>Shoot her!
Shoot her!</i>

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:24.790
<i>Hey... Hey!</i>

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.390
I-I...

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.390
<i>Don't talk. You don't
have to say anything.</i>

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:32.190
<i>I did it for Rita's sake...</i>

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.820
<i>I know, so don't talk!</i>

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:38.790
<i>I pinched this one...</i>

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:46.710
<i>Use that to treat Rita's eyes...</i>

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:47.970
All right.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:56.420
<i>I was a no- good father
to her to the very end...</i>

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.720
<i>You idiot!
Don't you die!</i>

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.980
<i>You have to live
and go back to Rita!</i>

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.470
<i>Wh-What are you waiting for?!
H-Hurry up and get rid of her!</i>

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:15.090
<i>B-But she...</i>

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.210
<i>The machineguns
don't work on her!</i>

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.640
<i>How dare you...</i>

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:22.630
<i>How dare you!</i>

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.480
Damn it!

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:30.280
<i>Solty!</i>

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.770
<i>What about Mr. Vincent?!</i>

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.120
<i>Hurry up and kill them!</i>

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.970
<i>Damn it, there are
too many of them.</i>

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.530
<i>Mr. Vincent! Mr. Vincent!</i>

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.110
<i>Sorry, but I'm going to use this.</i>

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:08.180
<i>If we make it out alive,
I'll pay you back for it.</i>

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:25.170
Ow...

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:26.740
<i>It's over.</i>

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:29.880
<i>No! Mr. Vincent!</i>

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:34.080
<i>You must not!</i>

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.880
Miss Rita said...

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.120
<i>...that she is grateful to you.</i>

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.920
Miss Rita said...

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:45.150
<i>...that you are a precious
part of her family!</i>

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:50.730
<i>So...</i>

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:54.220
<i>So, you cannot do this!</i>

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.140
<i>What? Uncle said that?</i>

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:06.010
<i>He said he'd be
going away for a while.</i>

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.450
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.150
<i>He entrusted me with the money
for your operation.</i>

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:13.590
<i>It's to resemblize
your eyes and legs.</i>

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:14.590
What?

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:17.960
<i>If you're interested in the operation,
I'll make the arrangements.</i>

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:21.700
<i>Someone from the central hospital
should come for you in two days.</i>

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.730
<i>What do you want to do?</i>

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:26.200
<i>Um, where is Uncle right now?</i>

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.440
<i>I don't know. Even we have
no idea of his whereabouts.</i>

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.730
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.180
Um...

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:38.880
<i>If you see him, please tell him
that I said, "Thank you."</i>

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.240
<i>I will have the operation.</i>

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.550
All right.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.950
<i>Also...</i>

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:48.660
<i>Please tell him that I'll
wait forever for him to come back.</i>

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.260
<i>Please tell my father that.</i>

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:54.420
<i>S-Sure, you got it.</i>

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:03.670
<i>You sure you don't
want to see her?</i>

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.110
<i>S-Sorry.</i>

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:08.840
<i>Don't sweat it. It's payback
for the P-10 crystal.</i>

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.710
<i>The bounty for you and Cary's
gang will more than cover it.</i>

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:12.870
What?

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:17.180
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:26.490
<i>Solty...</i>

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:33.330
<i>M-Miss Rose?</i>

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.170
<i>Oh, welcome back.</i>

00:21:35.170 --> 00:21:38.270
<i>I'm going to be living here
for a while starting today, so...</i>

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.900
<i>Say hi to your roomie!</i>

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:58.230
<i>Hareta hi no kouen</i>

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:01.160
<i>Miageta sora ni</i>

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:12.440
<i>Kiesou ni natta chiisana
Little Cloud</i>

00:22:12.440 --> 00:22:17.210
<i>Kaze ni mi o makasete</i>

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:20.150
<i>Jiyuu ni ikiru</i>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:28.190
<i>Sukoshi-zutsu
aruku watashi-tachi</i>

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:32.960
<i>Onnaji dane</i>

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:37.700
<i>Taisetsu na jikan</i>

00:22:37.700 --> 00:22:41.540
<i>Deau tabi ni</i>

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:51.080
<i>Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru</i>

00:22:51.080 --> 00:22:57.650
<i>Dareka o shinjiru
yuuki ni kaete</i>

00:22:57.650 --> 00:23:09.960
<i>Kitto kono mama ano sora
no hate ni kieru mae ni</i>

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:18.840
<i>What's with this dirty place?</i>

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:22.380
<i>What? Is my cleaning
not good enough?</i>

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.310
<i>Next time, "The Imp's Visit".</i>

00:23:24.310 --> 00:23:26.510
<i>Your room is mine!</i>
